      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried writing a test but it requires selinux permission of various sysfs paths to shell \u0026 I\u0027m not sure its the right thing to do?\n\nEither way, can we create a bug for this? The scope of this patch was refactoring the Path based addition \u0026 we already use this vendor_hashtree, so there might already be u-droid tests.\n\n```\n    #[test]\n    fn path_addition() {\n        let mut buffer \u003d vec![0_u8; 10_000];\n        const MANDATORY_PATH_DT: \u0026str \u003d \"/proc/device-tree/chosen\";\n        let fdt \u003d create_device_tree_overlay(\n            \u0026mut buffer,\n            \u0026[\n                DtAddition::FromPath(Path::new(MANDATORY_PATH_DT)),\n                DtAddition::AvfUntrustedProp(cstr!(\"XOXO\"), b\"0X0X\"),\n            ],\n        )\n        .unwrap();\n        let chosen \u003d fdt\n            .node(cstr!(\"/fragment@0/__overlay__\"))\n            .unwrap()\n            .expect(\"chosen node doesn\u0027t exist\");\n            \n        let bootargs \u003d chosen.getprop_str(cstr!(\"bootargs\"))\n            .unwrap();\n        assert!(bootargs.is_some(), \"bootargs missing\");\n    }\n```",
